{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME ABOARD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/f6b96c0abd19dae4e054e9f0ff673dfc.poster.avif?t=1772702180\" width=748 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/f6b96c0abd19dae4e054e9f0ff673dfc.webm?t=1772702180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/f6b96c0abd19dae4e054e9f0ff673dfc.mp4?t=1772702180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well we all know why you are here...<strong>To capture ghosts of course!</strong>  <br>Come right through and enter the shoes of <strong>Ray</strong>, a rookie ghost hunter.  <br>You'll be exploring a haunted hotel, capturing ghosts, and doing other <i><strong>FUN stuff.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE CHARACTERS</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/1d4e5954a91ba375ae7b38b9f550c1cb.avif?t=1772702180\" width=748 height=314 /></span>There has been news about a group of <i>naughty</i> <strong>Ghost Girls</strong> causing a havoc in an abandoned hotel. It is your job to clear the hotel of any ghosts and stop the Ghost Girls! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/5ca973a09f66f5949055b02403ad52a9.avif?t=1772702180\" width=748 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as\u00a0<strong>Ray</strong>, a\u00a0scaredy cat who just graduated from the\u00a0<i>Ghost Hunters Academy</i>!  <br>And it's time to get your first mission as an official <strong>Ghost Hunter</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/463b494214f3294a56d6156d5ba143a4.avif?t=1772702180\" width=748 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is BIG BOSS, <strong>CEO of the &quot;Ghost Hunters&quot;</strong>.  <br>He might seem small, but <strong>this isn't even his final form!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/820e052dd5ebb41f85193ad87f3ede81.avif?t=1772702180\" width=748 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let her cuteness fool you!  <br>She is the <strong>leader of the &quot;Ghost Girls&quot;</strong>, a very powerful ghost, and... <i>well</i>... <i>a very horny one</i>!<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/9f31212c1556dcfeaa7e4d09edd9854f.avif?t=1772702180\" width=748 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Psycho</strong> of the Ghost Girls!  <br>She might be <strong>petite</strong>, <i>but are you sure you'll be able to handle her</i>?<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/c1ff9618e567fe31885589894f3ddbf7.avif?t=1772702180\" width=748 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Known as the gardener, she is the most powerful ghost in the group.  <br>She loves her plants, reading, and... <strong>HEY! STOP STARING AT HER BOOBS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> <br><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER A HAUNTED HOTEL, FILLED WITH MYSTERY AND SECRETS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/28c4dfb87fe24c9c73e3772d1b6bec7a.avif?t=1772702180\" width=748 height=314 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, solve puzzles, capture ghosts,</strong> and...<strong><i>HAVE SEX?!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Featuring</u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secrets and unlocks like classic games of the past!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 crazy floors to explore and exorcise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight unique and sexy boss girl battles! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Interactive Sex Scenes to claim victory on those sexy ghosts!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple poses, angles and fully voiced to help you reach your climax!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Minigames to keep your hands busy~</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAN OF CULTURE\u00a0( \u0361\u00b0 \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0) </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675870/extras/273f2f7367bf983efb8f169862f9a2f1.avif?t=1772702180\" width=748 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like <i>every good game</i>, this game contains <strong>Sexual Content</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Featuring</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple poses and locations  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free camera movement </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person mode ;) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caressing</p><